{\fontsize{34}{40}\selectfont\bfseries\color{ChapterMantle}\kaiti\selectfont 話與燈}\\[0.10cm]
{\fontsize{16}{20}\selectfont\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} The Word and the Lamp}

\vspace{0.20cm}
{\fontsize{22}{26}\selectfont\bfseries\kaiti\selectfont 列王紀下研讀}\\[0.08cm]
{\fontsize{13}{16}\selectfont\itshape\color{TextGray} A Study of the Second Book of Kings}

\vspace{0.24cm}
{\fontsize{15}{18}\selectfont\itshape\color{ChapterMantle} מְלָכִים}\quad
{\footnotesize\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} “Melakhim”}\quad
{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{ExileSlate} 列王 / Kings}

\vfill

\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.3in}
\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{ExileSlate}\kaiti\selectfont
「耶和華卻因他僕人大衛的緣故，仍不肯滅絕猶大，照他所應許大衛的話，永遠賜燈光與他的子孫。」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{TextGray}
“Yet the LORD was not willing to destroy Judah, for the sake of David His servant, since He had promised to give a lamp to him through his sons always.”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{ChapterMantle} 列王紀下 8:19 \textperiodcentered\ 2 Kings 8:19}
\vspace{0.15cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — 全書一句話, built on the book's own purpose sentence
%% (17:7) and its last scene (25:27-30).
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterMantle} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
這是\textbf{\color{LampAmber!80!black}因}以色列人得罪那領他們出埃及地、脫離埃及王法老手的耶和華──他們的神，去敬畏別神。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
Now this came about because the sons of Israel had sinned against the LORD their God,
who had brought them up from the land of Egypt from under the hand of Pharaoh king of Egypt.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterMantle} 列王紀下 17:7 \textperiodcentered\ 2 Kings 17:7
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 二十五章 \textperiodcentered\ 六卷 \textperiodcentered\ 話先出口，事後成就；審判之後，燈仍亮著\\
\textit{Twenty-five chapters \textperiodcentered\ six volumes \textperiodcentered\ the word first, then the event; after judgment, the lamp still burns}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{3.7cm}p{1.9cm}p{6.5cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{啟示的次序} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
第一步 · 話先出口 & 1-8章 & 先知的話一出，水變甜、油不止、餅有餘；亞哈謝因問錯了神，死在自己的床上 \\
第二步 · 憐憫延遲審判 & 9-17章 & 耶戶得「四代」，約哈斯一懇求就得拯救者，「尚未趕逐」；然後是「這是因為」 \\
第三步 · 話被遺失又被尋見 & 18-23章 & 希西家專靠，亞述一夜退兵；律法書在耶和華殿裏被尋見 \\
第四步 · 燈仍亮著 & 24-25章 & 殿被焚，城破，王被擄；但約雅斤在巴比倫王的桌旁，終身有座位 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterMantle} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一部亡國史，是來聽一個一直沒有停過的聲音：
王換了，國亡了，只有那些說出口的話，一句一句落在地上。\\
若你讀完二十五章，只記得「以色列後來被擄了」——請從頭再讀，\\
這次每一章問三件事：誰的話先出口？人緊貼著甚麼？那盞燈亮在哪裏？\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
This is not a record of a collapse; it is a voice that never stopped.
Kings change and kingdoms fall; only the spoken words land, one after another.\\
If after twenty-five chapters you remember only "Israel was exiled," read it again,
and in each chapter ask three things: whose word comes first? what is being clung to?
where is the lamp?}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

